  "goodToKnow": "Der Chemiker (die Chemikerin) is a chemist, the scientist. A British chemist's shop is die Apotheke, and the pharmacist der Apotheker. German chemists include Justus von Liebig, Fritz Haber (ammonia synthesis) and Otto Hahn (nuclear fission, 1938). Angela Merkel earned a doctorate in quantum chemistry. Ch is pronounced as in ich in the north and as k in the south. Plural: die Chemiker."
